  "body": "Set on a 421m² section in Red Beach, this single-level property offers approximately 130m² of floor area, a flexible layout and plenty of possibilities. The property has previously been used for a home business and gives buyers plenty of scope to consider how the spaces might suit their own needs.\r\n\r\nInside, the expansive central living area provides a generous setting with exposed timber ceilings that add warmth and character. The separate kitchen offers bench space and cabinetry, while large windows bring natural light into the interior. A neutral palette keeps things fresh and inviting, complemented by a heat pump for year-round comfort. The existing layout provides plenty of flexibility for everyday living.\r\n\r\nThe property is recorded as having four bedrooms and one bathroom, with several rooms offering useful separation and privacy. Fitted shelving and additional cabinetry provide good storage, while a shower room, separate WC and dedicated laundry add everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nOutside, the easy-care 421m² section keeps maintenance manageable, leaving more time to enjoy the coastal lifestyle. Extensive paved parking accommodates four vehicles, with timber fencing providing separation from neighbouring properties. Two small decks offer separate access points, while established greenery and a modest lawn soften the surroundings. The dark exterior adds a contemporary touch and distinctive street presence.\r\n\r\nRed Beach is a lovely place to put down roots, with Red Beach School, local parks and the coastline within easy reach. Silverdale's shopping facilities and Orewa's cafés, restaurants and waterfront offer plenty of options for everyday outings and weekends.\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for a property with flexibility and a little something different, contact Scott Franks to arrange your viewing.",
